      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont want to rebuild. i don't want to have to spend the next decade explaining myself or looking over my shoulder or feeling everyone's pity every time i walk into a room. if you had to choose between living through years of being a walking cautionary tale or just... stopping before the crash actually happens, wouldn't you? wouldn't it be more dignified to just exit on your own terms instead of letting life humiliate you bit by bit?",
